		{
			"parameters": {
				"content": "## Create a sales order and close it\nCreates a sales order with three lines, then closes it with the bound action **Close**, using the `DocEntry` the create returned.\n\nThe lines are one JSON array in **Order data**, passed to the **DocumentLines** field as is. Add or remove entries there; any line field of SAP Business One (`Price`, `WarehouseCode`, …) can go into an entry. When the lines arrive as one item each, combine them first with an **Aggregate** node.\n\nSet a customer and items of your company in **Order data** first. A closed order stays in the database; use a test company.",
				"height": 260,
				"width": 420
			},
